  "body": "MAKE AN OFFER\r\n                                             ( All offer over $1,410,000 considered )\r\n                                                 Trademe Ref# 6167772937\r\nBuyers seeking a quality, spacious, architectural designed 4 bedroom family home in a popular, well sought after area need look no further. This 236m2 low maintenance, split level home, offering premium comfort, rare value, easy care section and garden, and effortlessly outclasses high density modern developments.\r\n\r\nJust a  stroll to the fantastic beach, parks, the boutique Village and cafes in Orewa, along with the highly regarded local schools and child care centres.\r\n\r\nPositioned North facing, this home maximises the natural light with great afternoon winter sun, featuring full double glazed windows (with slight tint), high efficiency heat pumps, and a Masport fireplace which serves as a focal point for the lounge.\r\n\r\nA very spacious lounge, with a small \"nook,\" modern kitchen with a breakfast bar, dining/family room. The large master bedroom features a walk in wardrobe and ensuite. The split level floor plan offers exceptional flexibility for a completely independent bedroom and bathroom, perfect for an extended family, teenage retreat, independent guest, accommodation like AirBnB, rumpus room or the executive work from home office.\r\n\r\nFrom the kitchen/dining area, is an easy transition to an expansive timber deck, with a permanent quality gazebo. This sheltered alfresco dining/entertainment area offers year round entertaining area, and overlooks a private fully fenced grassed area which is great for the kids or pets. There is a separate workshop, two garden sheds, three outside power outlets offering two great locations to install a spa pool.\r\n\r\nCatering to the coastal lifestyle, this property features good off street parking for a boat, motorhome or caravan, alongside a secure internal acess double garage. \r\n\r\nAn easy commute into Auckland City, with an excellent bus service in the area, and  the property is only a short distance to the motorway for both north and south travel.\r\n\r\nThe Vendors are genuine sellers and need this property SOLD  to move on.\r\n\r\n***Please note under Homes.co.nz  it shows this property was sold on 27 March 2024 N/A. This  \"sale\" was the dissolvement of a Family Trust entity.",
